<title>GERMANY: Bayer details H1 results by sector.</title>
<headline>Bayer details H1 results by sector.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  27,418  vs 24,797</p>
<p>By segment</p>
<p>     Health care				 6,455   vs 5,873</p>
<p>     Agriculture				 3,254   vs 2,903</p>
<p>     Polymers				    8,338   vs 7,433</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   5,461   vs 4,879</p>
<p>     Agfa					  3,910   vs 3,709</p>
<p>    Group operating result		   2,959   vs 2,783</p>
<p>By segment</p>
<p>     Health care				 766     vs 1,040</p>
<p>     Agriculture				 761     vs 621</p>
<p>     Polymers				    868     vs 760</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   348     vs 229</p>
<p>     Agfa					  216     vs 133</p>
<p>    Return on sales			    10.8%   vs 11.2%</p>
<p>By segment</p>
<p>     Health care				 11.9%   vs 17.7%</p>
<p>     Agriculture				 23.4%   vs 21.4%</p>
<p>     Polymers				    10.4%   vs 10.2%</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   6.4%    vs 4.7%</p>
<p>     Agfa					  5.5%    vs 3.6%</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical group is Bayer AG .</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
